## Generated Components (`sdn/`)

`packages/editor/apps/react/sdn/` and `packages/editor/apps/vue/sdn/` are generated
by the Seldon exporter. A re-export rewrites the whole folder, so any hand edit
here is lost.

- Do not hand-edit files under `sdn/`, including component views, `refs/`,
  `styles/`, `styles.css`, and `scripts/`.
- To change a generated component, edit the design in the editor, then re-export
  with `npm run export:seldon` (React) or `npm run export:seldon:vue` (Vue).
- After wiring refs in app code, refresh the binding manifest with `npm run bindings`.
- The files under `sdn/rules/` are the copyable consumer rules Seldon emits, not
  this repo's rules. Change them in the generator at
  `packages/factory/export/shared/generate-rules.ts`, then re-export.
